ngressional Medal of Honor.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16664,\"title\":\"All About Lily Chou-Chou\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pLBNmJUH9JYRCRsh349PJ22WpkS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wTWy7b1SKslcNn1GDah6S7MQa5p.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Charts the troubled teenage years of students Yūichi Hasumi and Shūsuke Hoshino, exploring the shifting and complex power dynamics of their relationship against the backdrop of Yūichi's love for the dreamy and abstract music of pop star Lily Chou-Chou.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":750509,\"title\":\"The Man Who Changed Okinawa\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tXC4J1KPQFExIQNo2vHMC4G5Pu5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A teacher leads an unlikely team to a high school baseball championship in this sports drama. Managing a team on the verge of extinction, teacher Hiroyoshi rallies the squad on an underdog journey.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1293968,\"title\":\"Hero's Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dG3lIC1EbYyjBCnSgYHaZVNLYKh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Nx5e2gW12LKnTdRBv0xl4Qd6eo.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set in post-war Okinawa, Japan, Gusuku had 3 close childhood friends: On, Yamako and On's younger brother Rei. On was the oldest of the group and he was like a leader to everybody else. He was also a heroic figure to them. On led his friends into the U.S. military base and they stole supplies to give away to the local residents. Everybody in the neighborhood praised On. One night, they entered the U.S. military based to steal supplies. During their raid, On was chased by U.S. soldiers and went missing. Years later, Gusuku now works as a police officer. Yamako is an elementary school teacher. Rei is a member of the yakuza. These three people are still unable to get over the disappearance of On. They chase after the truth behind On's disappearance and uncover a shocking answer.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":926384,\"title\":\"Revival Blues\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nRDhErUj5o4Zk829QvytIxMFBPP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":75679,\"title\":\"Tears for You\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jZ0sqiQcIRAPr349LjCN219Xic7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k7MnhJvh1PlY3MIgckNk9weKO9K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A love story about two step-siblings, Yota and Kaoru. Long ago, Yota's mother married Kaoru's jazz-playing father, effectively merging the two families. Unfortunately, Kaoru's father skipped town, and Yota's mother passed away, but not before imparting a dying wish to her young son to take care of Kaoru.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":359344,\"title\":\"Rage\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tO1rD0bNOaxnvhtEUu08Bvhhn7c.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uEGZJr6lWnbSVvXK8TbKefIEzVr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man brutally murders a married couple and leaves the word “ikari” (“rage”) written with their blood. The killer undergoes plastic surgery and flees. At three different locations in Japan, a male stranger appears. People suspect that the stranger might be the murderer.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":326666,\"title\":\"The Catcher On The Shore\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wIMFVGkUnVCc78y5FcEeGpBaEFF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This drama depicts a boy's coming of age against the backdrop of Okinawa's food culture. Director Nakamura Ryugo was born in 1996. He made this film, his feature debut, when he was just fourteen years old. Okinawa has an old tradition of eating a goat for celebratory occasions. But that culture is starting to fade in urban areas. Yuto (Uehara Soji), a sixth grader living in Naha, spends his winter vacation in the countryside town where his grandparents reside. He receives a shock when he sees the goat raised by his grandfather killed by locals.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1736503,\"title\":\"The Color of the Sun\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s9adCoe5fBPTysUovjkCMVxAnLd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k7ZBAS71NNnY7wMyL8fEhv3rlQJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During summer break on Okinawa's main island, Kamei and his friends face uncertain futures, until they meet Colin, a teenager from the American base in Naha, and everything changes.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":320445,\"title\":\"Happiness in August\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teru, a 17-year-old high school student, goes to live at a relative's house in Okinawa after the death of his mother. He becomes aware of a mysterious and powerful force within their family. Then, one day, he encounters a mysterious man with the soul of a tree?! The story of a mystical journey, against the backdrop of spirit-filled Okinawa Island.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"VWcOTcEUCRE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"rQcZgHl6yeM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"-obFE09lcRQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}